{"id":"P041-1","subject":"P","unit":"P041","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P041-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n전위함수가 V일 때, 점(1, -2, 3)에서의\n\n전계의 세기Vm는?\n\n\n①      ② \n\n③      ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":794}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n\n  진공상의 공간에 존재하는 점전하 C으로부터\n\n  발산되는 전기력선의 수는 (    )개이다.\n\n\n\n                                    \n①          ② \n\n                \n③             ④                               \n   \n⑤      ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":693},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":634}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n내외 반지름이 각각 m, m이고, 내외 도체간 공기로\n\n채워진 동축 케이블이 있다. 케이블의 내외 반지름을 각각\n\n2배로 늘리고, 내외 도체간에 비유전율이 2인 매질을 넣은\n경우의 정전용량Fm은 초기 정전용량 Fm과 비교\n\n할 때, 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":620},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1834}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n평행판 콘덴서 내의 전속밀도가 × Cm이고,\n유전체의 체적당 축적된 에너지가 × Jm인 경우,\n\n평행판 콘덴서 극판간에 채워진 매질의 유전율Fm은?\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 0.2\n\n③ 0.3          ④ 0.4\n\n⑤ 0.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":532},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":742}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  C의 전하가 진공중에서 자계Am에 수직방향\n\n 으로 ms의 속도로 원운동을 할 때, 원운동 반경은\n\n 전하의 질량과 ( ㉠   ), 자속밀도와 ( ㉡   ), 전하의\n\n 속도와 ( ㉢  )한다.\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n ①    비례      반비례      비례\n ②    비례      비례      비례\n ③    비례      반비례     반비례\n ④    반비례      비례      비례\n ⑤    반비례      비례      반비례","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1140}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n인 영역에 인 유전체, 인 영역에\n인 유전체가 있다. 인 영역에서 전계가\nVm일 때, 인 영역에서의\n전속밀도 Cm은?\n\n\n① \n② \n③ \n④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":621},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m06-e2.webp","width":678,"height":703}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n선전하 밀도가 × Cm인 무한직선도선으로부터\n1m 떨어진 지점과 4m 떨어진 지점과의 전위V는?\n\n\n                      \n①       ln       ②       ln     \n                      \n③       ln       ④       ln     \n   \n⑤       ln ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":570},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1181},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m07-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n단면적이 0.1cm인 철심에 작용하는 자속이 × \n\n일 때, 철심내의 자계의 세기ATm는?\n\n(단, 철심의 비투자율은 450이다.)\n\n\n                           \n①            ②                                 \n\n                           \n③            ④                                 \n\n    \n⑤     ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":509}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":fa