        분로 리액터\n\n ②      Y결선        직렬 리액터\n\n ③     △결선        소호 리액터\n\n ④     △결선        분로 리액터\n\n ⑤     △결선        직렬 리액터","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":749},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":634}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n특성 임피던스가 200Ω인 무손실 선로의 말단에 저항\n\n1000Ω의 부하가 접속되어 있다. 입사되는 전압파가\n\n15kV일 때, 반사파 전압kV은?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②                           \n③         ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":571},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1248}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n경간 200m의 지지점이 수평인 가공 전선로에서 전선\n\n1m당 하중은 2kgm, 전선의 인장하중은 4000kg,\n\n안전율은 2로 하면 이도m는?\n\n(단, 풍압하중 및 빙설하중은 고려하지 않는다.)\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1017}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n60Hz, 5000V, 10km인 3상 송전선로에서 1상당\n\n작용 정전용량이 0.5Fkm일 때, 1선에 흐르는 충전전\n\n류A 는?\n\n①            ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":612},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":865}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n다음 설명에 대한 보호 계전기는?\n\n 일반적으로 비접지 계통 다회선 선로에서 지락 발생시\n\n 고장회선만을 선택하여 차단할 수 있는 방향성 계전기\n\n 로, 지락시 계전기 설치점에 나타나는 영상전압과 영상\n\n 전류의 위상각으로 동작여부를 결정하여 선택차단한다.\n\n\n\n① 선택 단락계전기    ② 선택 지락계전기\n\n③ 방향 지락계전기    ④ 지락 과전류계전기\n\n⑤ 지락 과전압계전기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":628},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n다음 설명이 의미하는 것은?\n\n 보일러 급수 중의 염류 등이 굳어서 내벽에 부착되어\n\n 보일러의 열전도와 물의 순환을 방해하며, 내면의\n\n 수관벽을 과열시켜 파열을 일으키는 원인이 된다.\n\n\n\n① 스케일        ② 부식\n\n③ 포밍         ④ 프라이밍\n\n⑤ 캐리오버","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":605},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1273}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  전선의 굵기가 균일하고 부하가 균등하게 분산되어\n\n  있는 배전선로는 부하가 선로 말단에 집중되어 있는\n\n  경우와 비교할 때, 전압강하는 ( ㉠ )배, 전력손실은\n\n    ( ㉡ )배이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n                                      \n ①                                         \n\n                                      \n ②                                         \n\n                                      \n ③                                         \n\n                                      \n ④                                         \n\n                                      \n ⑤                                         ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":899},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":609}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n송전계통의 절연협조에 있어서 절연 레벨을 가장 높게\n\n잡고있는 것은?\n\n\n① 기기부싱       ② 선로애자\n\n③ 피뢰기        ④ 차단기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":379},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m24-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P041-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n단면적이 10cm인 변압기 철심의 자속밀도가 1T 일\n\n때, 1차측 전압이 2220V, 2차측 전압이 2.22V였다.\n\n변압기 2차측 코일의 턴수는?\n\n(단, 주파수는 50Hz이다.)\n\n\n① 10          ② 100\n\n③ 1000         ④ 5000\n\n⑤ 10000","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.13 지역난방공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e01-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":607},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e01-m25-e1.webp","width":678,"height":575}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
